#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:1
msgid "HM-D20-LoRa 首次使用"
msgstr "HM-D20-LoRa Getting Started"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:6
msgid ""
"将 **HM-D20-LoRa 套件**从开箱状态运行到移动站首次获得 **RTK 固定解**。套件使"
"用本地 LoRa 差分链路，不需要 SIM 卡或 CORS 账号。"
msgstr ""
"Use this guide to take the **HM-D20-LoRa kit** from unboxing to the rover's "
"first **RTK fixed solution**. Its local LoRa correction link requires no SIM "
"card or CORS account."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:9
msgid "1. 核对套件"
msgstr "Step 1: Check the kit"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:11
msgid "产品配备："
msgstr "Package includes:"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:12
msgid "HM-D20-LoRa 移动站、8-pin 连接线和外置 LoRa 天线。"
msgstr "HM-D20-LoRa rover, 8-pin cable, and external LoRa antenna."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:13
msgid "兼容 3.3 V UART I/O 的 USB 转 UART 转接器。"
msgstr "USB-to-UART adapter compatible with 3.3 V UART I/O."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:14
msgid ""
"配套专用 D13 LoRa 基站硬件、基站外置 LoRa 天线和封装好的 4-pin USB 线缆。"
msgstr ""
"Dedicated D13 LoRa base station, external base-station LoRa antenna, and "
"sealed 4-pin USB cable."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:15
msgid ""
"基站安装支架及随套件提供的附件。基站和移动站出厂默认配对，上电自动连接。"
msgstr ""
"Base-station mounting hardware and kit accessories. The base station and "
"rover are factory-paired and connect automatically at power-on."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:17
msgid "用户自备："
msgstr "User provides:"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:18
msgid "移动站和基站所需的 5 V ±0.5 V 电源。"
msgstr "5 V ±0.5 V power supplies for the rover and base station."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:25
msgid "HM-D20-LoRa 移动站主要组件与包装"
msgstr "HM-D20-LoRa rover components and packaging"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:25
msgid "HM-D20-LoRa 移动站主要组件"
msgstr "HM-D20-LoRa rover components"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:33
msgid "配套 D13 LoRa 基站主要组件与包装"
msgstr "Included D13 LoRa base-station components and packaging"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:33
msgid "配套 D13 LoRa 基站主要组件"
msgstr "Included D13 LoRa base-station components"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:37
msgid ""
"图片用于辅助识别产品和主要组件；实际交付内容以本页文字清单和随货装箱清单为"
"准。"
msgstr ""
"Images are provided to help identify the product and its major components. "
"The written list on this page and the packing list supplied with the product "
"define the actual contents."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:40
msgid "2. 确认输出固件"
msgstr "Step 2: Confirm the output firmware"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:42
msgid "接入 ArduPilot、PX4 等飞控：使用无人机版固件，默认输出 10 Hz UBX。"
msgstr ""
"For ArduPilot, PX4, and similar flight controllers, use the UAV firmware; it "
"defaults to 10 Hz UBX."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:43
msgid "接入机器人、Viobot2 或 PC：使用地面版固件，默认输出 10 Hz NMEA。"
msgstr ""
"For robots, Viobot2, or a PC, use the ground firmware; it defaults to 10 Hz "
"NMEA."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:45
msgid "具体选择请查看[固件与输出协议选择](../operation/firmware-output.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Selecting Firmware and Output Protocol](../operation/firmware-output."
"md) for details."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:47
msgid "3. 架设 D13 基站"
msgstr "Step 3: Set up the D13 base station"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:49
msgid ""
"按[LoRa 基站架设](../differential-links/d13-base-station.md)完成安装和供电。"
"基站上电后保持静止；移动后需要重新上电。"
msgstr ""
"Follow [Setting Up the LoRa Base Station](../differential-links/d13-base-"
"station.md) to install and power the base station. Keep it stationary after "
"power-on; power-cycle it after any move."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:51
msgid "4. 安装移动站天线"
msgstr "Step 4: Install the rover antenna"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:53
msgid ""
"断电状态下，将 D20 外置 LoRa 天线连接到 SMA 接口并拧紧。移动站与基站之间尽量"
"保持无遮挡或弱遮挡。"
msgstr ""
"With power off, connect and tighten the D20 external LoRa antenna on the SMA "
"connector. Keep the path between the rover and base station as unobstructed "
"as possible."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:55
msgid "5. 连接移动站"
msgstr "Step 5: Connect the rover"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:58
msgid ""
"接线错误会损坏设备 保持设备断电并按[完整 8-pin 定义](../operation/d20-wiring."
"md)逐线核对。设备供电为 5 V ±0.5 V，UART/PPS I/O 为 3.3 V；禁止按导线颜色判"
"断、反接电源或把 5 V 接入信号线。"
msgstr ""
"Wiring errors can damage the device. Keep it powered off and verify every "
"wire against the [complete 8-pin pinout](../operation/d20-wiring.md). Supply "
"5 V ±0.5 V; UART/PPS I/O is 3.3 V. Do not rely on wire colors, reverse the "
"supply, or connect 5 V to a signal pin."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:61
msgid ""
"按[D20 接口与接线](../operation/d20-wiring.md)完成 5 V ±0.5 V 供电、共地和 "
"TX/RX 交叉连接，逐线复核后再上电。"
msgstr ""
"Following [D20 Interfaces and Wiring](../operation/d20-wiring.md), connect 5 "
"V ±0.5 V power, common ground, and crossed TX/RX. Verify every pin before "
"power-on."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:63
msgid "6. 查看定位输出"
msgstr "Step 6: Check positioning output"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:65
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"串口默认 115200 bps。使用地面版固件时，按{ref}`连接 NavStarTool <connect-"
"navstartool>`或使用串口终端确认 10 Hz NMEA 持续输出；使用无人机版固件时，通过"
"目标飞控及其地面站确认 UBX 定位数据和 GPS 状态持续更新。"
msgstr ""
"The serial port defaults to 115200 bps. When using the ground firmware, "
"follow {ref}`Connecting to NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>` or use a "
"serial terminal to verify continuous 10 Hz NMEA output; when using the UAV "
"firmware, verify continuous updates of UBX positioning data and GPS status "
"through the target flight controller and its ground station."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:67
msgid "7. 验证 RTK 固定解"
msgstr "Step 7: Verify RTK Fixed Solution"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:69
msgid ""
"按[LoRa 移动站连接](../differential-links/lora.md)和[RTK 状态与固定解验证]"
"(../operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md)检查定位输出和解状态。"
msgstr ""
"Follow [Connecting a LoRa Rover](../differential-links/lora.md) and "
"[Checking RTK Status and the Fixed Solution](../operation/rtk-fixed-"
"validation.md) to verify positioning output and solution status."

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:71
msgid "首次使用完成判据"
msgstr "Getting Started success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:74
msgid "**基站稳定工作，移动站持续输出定位数据并进入 RTK 固定解。**"
msgstr ""
"**The base station remains stable, and the rover outputs positioning data "
"continuously and reaches an RTK fixed solution.**"

#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/hm-d20-lora.md:77
msgid ""
"若无法进入固定解，检查基站是否被移动、两端 LoRa 天线、基站供电、链路遮挡和天"
"空视野，再进入[故障排查](../troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md)。"
msgstr ""
"If the receiver does not achieve a fixed solution, check whether the base "
"station was moved, both LoRa antennas, base-station power, link "
"obstructions, and sky visibility, then continue to [Troubleshooting](../"
"troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md)."

